{
 "file": "15MKR02F base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:1b9",
   "ptr": "0x1b9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「《黒竜洞》はドラールの村の北東にあ\\n",
   "en": "\"The Black Dragon Cave is northeast of Dral Village.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:1e2",
   "ptr": "0x1e2",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　ります」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:1b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:226",
   "ptr": "0x226",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「《黒竜洞》の通路は三つに分かれてま\\n",
   "en": "\"The passage in the Black Dragon Cave splits three ways, but any of them will take you to the ruins.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:24f",
   "ptr": "0x24f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　すが、どれを通っても遺跡へたどり着\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:226"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:278",
   "ptr": "0x278",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　くことができますよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:226"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:294",
   "ptr": "0x294",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　でも、できるなら、いちばん右の通路\\n",
   "en": "Still, if you can, you might want to avoid the passage on the far right. There's a nasty monster there.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:2bd",
   "ptr": "0x2bd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　だけは通らないほうがいいかもしれま\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:294"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:2e6",
   "ptr": "0x2e6",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　せん。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:294"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:2f3",
   "ptr": "0x2f3",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　やっかいな魔物がいますから」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　せん。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:294"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:34c",
   "ptr": "0x34c",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「《黒竜洞》へ行くのですか？\\f",
   "en": "\"You're going to the Black Dragon Cave?",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:36e",
   "ptr": "0x36e",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　・・・そうですか。\\n",
   "en": "...I see. We'll keep up our survey a while longer. Please, take care...\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:387",
   "ptr": "0x387",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わたしたちは、もう少し調査を続けて\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・そうですか。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:36e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:3b0",
   "ptr": "0x3b0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　みることにします。どうか、お気をつ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:36e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:3d9",
   "ptr": "0x3d9",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　けて・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:36e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:42c",
   "ptr": "0x42c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「入り江へ向かう途中にある鉱山は、地\\n",
   "en": "\"At the mine on the way to the cove, the deeper they dug, the more miners fell to a mystery illness, until it had to be shut down.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:455",
   "ptr": "0x455",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　下へ掘り進むにつれて、鉱夫たちが原\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:42c"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:47e",
   "ptr": "0x47e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　因不明の病に倒れることが多くなり、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:42c"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:4a7",
   "ptr": "0x4a7",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　閉鎖せざるを得なくなったんです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:42c"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:4cf",
   "ptr": "0x4cf",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　体が徐々に衰弱してくような感じ\\n",
   "en": "The kind where the body slowly wastes away... The same illness Riel had.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:4f4",
   "ptr": "0x4f4",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　の・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:4cf"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:503",
   "ptr": "0x503",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　リールがかかっていた病と同じもので\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　の・・・",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:4cf"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:52c",
   "ptr": "0x52c",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　す。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:4cf"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:538",
   "ptr": "0x538",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今までは伝染病の一種かと思われてま\\n",
   "en": "Until now it was thought to be some sort of plague, but thanks to Riel's work, we know it was the Black Ore.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:561",
   "ptr": "0x561",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　したが、今回、リールの働きで、それ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:538"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:58a",
   "ptr": "0x58a",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　が《黒い鉱石》のせいだと解りました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:538"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:5b6",
   "ptr": "0x5b6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　鉱石そのものを分析しても、何ら毒素\\n",
   "en": "No toxins turned up when the ore itself was analyzed, so no one realized it was the cause.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:5df",
   "ptr": "0x5df",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　が検出されなかったため、それが原因\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:5b6"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:608",
   "ptr": "0x608",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　とは誰も気づかなかったんです\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:5b6"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:62c",
   "ptr": "0x62c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　『毒』ではない何かを常に放射し、周\\n",
   "en": "To think it always gives off something that isn't 'poison,' making everything around it crumble...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:655",
   "ptr": "0x655",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　りにある物、すべてを崩壊させていく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:62c"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:67e",
   "ptr": "0x67e",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　なんて・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:62c"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:692",
   "ptr": "0x692",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　これをいったい、どう解釈したらいい\\n",
   "en": "How on earth are we to make sense of that...?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:6bb",
   "ptr": "0x6bb",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　のか・・・？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:692"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:6d3",
   "ptr": "0x6d3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「最近の調査では、《黒い鉱石》の発見\\n",
   "en": "\"Recent surveys show that the closer you get to the Black Dragon Cave, the more Black Ore turns up. ...A very troubling result.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:6fc",
   "ptr": "0x6fc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　例は《黒竜洞》に近づくほど数を増し\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:6d3"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:725",
   "ptr": "0x725",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　ていることが解ってます。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:6d3"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:744",
   "ptr": "0x744",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・とても、気になる結果です」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ていることが解ってます。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:6d3"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:7ab",
   "ptr": "0x7ab",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「《封印の門》が発見されたのは、近年\\n",
   "en": "\"The Gate of Seals was discovered only in recent years.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:7d4",
   "ptr": "0x7d4",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　になってからのことです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:7ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:7f4",
   "ptr": "0x7f4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それまで《黒竜洞》といえば、魔物の\\n",
   "en": "Before that, the Black Dragon Cave was known as a monster nest, and no one went near it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:81d",
   "ptr": "0x81d",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　巣として、近づく者もいませんでした。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:7f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:849",
   "ptr": "0x849",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　正式な調査隊が投入され、遺跡を始め、\\n",
   "en": "An official survey team was sent in and made many finds, the ruins among them. But what blocked their way was a giant black crystal.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:874",
   "ptr": "0x874",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　数々の発見が成された時、彼らの行く\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:849"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:89d",
   "ptr": "0x89d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　手を阻んだのが巨大な黒水晶だったの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:849"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:8c6",
   "ptr": "0x8c6",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:849"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:8d4",
   "ptr": "0x8d4",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　そこから先に何があるのか・・・\\n",
   "en": "What lies beyond it... Even knowing it might be dangerous, we still want to see...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:8f9",
   "ptr": "0x8f9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　たとえそれが、危険な物だと知ってし\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:8d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:922",
   "ptr": "0x922",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　まっても、なお見てみたいと思う・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:8d4"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:94e",
   "ptr": "0x94e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それが、学者というものじゃないでし\\n",
   "en": "Isn't that what it means to be a scholar?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:977",
   "ptr": "0x977",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　ょうか？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:94e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:98b",
   "ptr": "0x98b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「あなたたちは、黒水晶が割られるのを\\n",
   "en": "\"You mean to stop them breaking the black crystal, don't you? Sorry to Riel, but I'm hoping you fail.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:9b4",
   "ptr": "0x9b4",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　止めに行くつもりなんでしょうね？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:98b"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:9db",
   "ptr": "0x9db",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　リールには悪いけど、私は、あなたた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:98b"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:a04",
   "ptr": "0xa04",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　ちが失敗するのを期待してますよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02F:98b"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:a6b",
   "ptr": "0xa6b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「前回、《黒竜洞》を調査した時、わた\\n",
   "en": "\"Last time we surveyed the Black Dragon Cave, we tried to tunnel through under the black crystal.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02F:a94",
